      "verdict": "revise",
      "reason": "The complete unit is on printed 90/PDF128. The difficult surrounding/encircling expression occurs in the printed edition and has apparatus entries; it must not be dismissed as an OCR repetition. The English is defensible as a smoothing, but the current notes misrepresent the evidence and have misplaced anchors. This is not approval of every supplied source glyph.",
      "suggested_text": "In that place I saw a spring of righteousness that never fails. Around it were many springs of wisdom. All the thirsty drank from them and were filled with wisdom, and their dwelling was with the righteous, the holy, and the chosen.",
