      "suggested_text": "Before the sun and the signs were created, before the stars of heaven were made, his name was called before the Lord of Spirits.",
      "footnote_changes": "Move a to the final 'before the Lord of Spirits.' Remove c and rewrite or remove b: it must not turn the selected wording into 'the signs of the stars.' A textual note may identify the signs expression as textually variable and record u's omission in printed note 22. Do not present the theological explanation in b as a cross-reference without an actual reference.",
