      "verdict": "revise",
      "reason": "This unit crosses printed 90–91/PDF128–129. Its continuation includes the world's creation and the concluding eternity expression; the supplied unit is not clipped at this page break. The current translation is substantially defensible, but its notes are misplaced and repetitive. The figure chosen and hidden and the one in whose presence he is hidden should not be conflated.",
      "suggested_text": "For this reason he was chosen and hidden in his presence before the world was created, and for ever.",
