      "verdict": "revise",
      "reason": "The complete unit is on printed 91/PDF129. The supplied asterisks after ወ and ለ are not supported by the displayed main line: apparatus numerals 21 and 23 must not be converted into asterisks. The first-person possessive and delivery verb support 'my chosen ones' and 'I will deliver them,' not 'I saw them.' The burning-clause placement is an editorially selected arrangement, not an uncontested manuscript sequence.",
      "suggested_text": "Into the hands of my chosen ones I will deliver them. Like grass in fire they will burn before the holy ones; like lead in water they will sink before the righteous, and no trace of them will be found.",
      "footnote_changes": "Correct a to retain 'my'; identify 'them' with the condemned rulers carried forward from verse 8, not all humanity. Printed note 26 says m omits the five-word block beginning with 'so,' while the other manuscripts place it after 'water'; the editor relocates it in the main text. Notes 27 and 30 record variation between the holy/righteous designations. Remove d and e as unsupported previous renderings, and keep the final statement future rather than describing an already completed event. Attach any grass/straw alternative to that image.",
